===Etymology===
From {{inh|it|VL.|*raglō}}, from {{m|la|*ragulāre}}, from {{inh|it|LL.|ragō}} (whence {{cog|fr|raire}}, {{m|fr|réer}}, {{cog|ro|rage}}). Compare {{cog|vec|rajar}}, {{m|vec|ragiar}}, {{cog|scn|ragghiari}}, {{cog|fr|railler}}, {{cog|oc|ralhar}}, {{cog|ca|rallar}}. The form {{m|it|ragliare}} in Italian may have been influenced by a northern Italian variant or Gallo-Romance language (cf. {{cog|pro|ralhar}}); compare the original form {{m|it|ragghiare}}.

